 167               /ROUTINE TO CHECK IF FAC<0; IF IT IS,FAC IS NEGATED AND NFLAG IS
 168               /SET TO 1
 169               
 170 005120  0000  NHNDLE, 0
 171 005121  1045          TAD HORD        /FETCH HIGH ORDER MANTISSA
 172 005122  7700          SMA CLA         /IS IT <0?
 173 005123  5326           JMP NFLGST     /NO-CLEAR NFLAG
 174 005124  4666          JMS I FNEGL     /YES-NEGATE FAC
 175 005125  7001          IAC             /AND SET NFLAG
 176 005126  3335  NFLGST, DCA NFLAG
 177 005127  5720          JMP I NHNDLE
 178               
 179               /ROUTINE TO NEGATE FAC IF NFLAG IS NOT =0
 180               
